Upstream material retained in this repository includes the original project's
module skeleton (Maven multi-module layout, MyBatis configuration styles) and,
where noted in file headers, original author attributions.

Secondary development contributed by 311miaowa, licensed under the Apache
License 2.0 as well; it includes, among other things:

  * the unified data source access layer (IDataSourceProvider SPI, capability
    enum, in-memory registry, unified query facade) for Elasticsearch, MySQL and
    PostgreSQL;
  * the semantic tool layer with per-stage capability policy
    (ai_stage_tool_policy, deny-by-default) replacing direct database tool
    exposure;
  * the four-step execution chain (analyze / execute / supervise / summarize)
    with quality-supervision feedback;
  * two-level evidence back-references (result-level rawRef and row-level
    _rawRef) with a strict event/model dual-channel that keeps technical
    pointers out of model prompts;
  * the read-only query guards (SQL template rendering with full parameter
    binding; Elasticsearch index/DSL whitelist guard).

